    bound_unsolved %Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationEvidence SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind
    bound_count_mismatch %Result SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationEvidence SelfhostMemoTraitPublicImplGenericInstantiationErrorKind

